AppIcon.png placeholder — supply a 1024x1024 PNG (or a per-size set) here before shipping.
The Xios app generates its icon via apps/Xios/make-icon.py; reuse that or drop a Ladybird
logo. Info.plist references CFBundleIconFiles = [AppIcon]. Not load-bearing for the first
on-device launch (a blank icon still installs + launches).
